category: Libs
build-depends: cygport liblo-devel
sdesc: "Library for easy interaction with monome devices (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libmonome is a library for easy interaction with monome devices. It currently
runs on Linux (on which it is primarily developed), OpenBSD, and Darwin/OS X."
